    "summary": "Coming-Sun is twice told to head off ponies and warriors, but they disappear into a ravine before he reaches them. A mysterious being then reveals himself, gives Coming-Sun a medicine bag and a downy feather, says he will make him a medicine-man rather than a leading warrior, and promises further nightly visits. Coming-Sun later gains a reputation for accurate predictions, and the being brings additional ritual items, including buzzard feathers used to hide warriors from enemies.",
    "language": "English",
    "quote_policy": "summarized"
  },
  "literal_observations": [
    {
