      "text": "A voice tells Coming-Sun to run and head off warriors driving ponies, but the warriors drive the ponies into a ravine and disappear.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:2",
      "text": "Coming-Sun is then told to head off a great crowd of warriors carrying long poles with scalps on them, but they also disappear into the ravine before he reaches them.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:3",
      "text": "Coming-Sun returns to the hill and cries until nearly morning.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "The mysterious being identifies himself as Foot-Prints-upon-Bank-of-River and says he is North-Wind, all kinds of birds, all kinds of animals, and even the grass and the trees.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:5",
      "text": "The being gives Coming-Sun a little bag of medicine that he carries on his belt.",
      "category": "object",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:6",
      "text": "The being says he had tried to make Coming-Sun a warrior, give him many ponies, and help him scalp the enemy, but instead will make him a medicine-man who can count coup and whose war parties will succeed, though he will never be a leading warrior.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:7",
      "text": "The being gives Coming-Sun a downy feather and tells him to put it on a pole and set the pole in the direction from which he wants the buffalo to come.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:8",
      "text": "Coming-Sun becomes a great man, directs his brothers where to capture ponies, and his predictions come true.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:9",
      "text": "The mysterious being visits Coming-Sun each night and brings him wonderful things.",
      "category": "sequence",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:10",
      "text": "One night the being brings buzzard feathers to be worn on the heads in a circle so that dust rises and hides the warriors from the enemy.",
