      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "The next day the young man takes the boy to a steep bank on a hill, tells him there is a covered opening there, and instructs him to hide behind a knoll and not watch the bank closely enough to learn how the buffalo come out.",
