    "summary": "End of the Scalped-Man medicine narrative and beginning of the Eagle Dance narrative: a wounded man is found healed, gives gifts to Scalped-Man, performs medicine power, defeats a powerful enemy while marked with white clay, and later kills himself after sensing Scalped-Man is gone; then a different missing man returns wearing eagle feathers, keeps apart from others, disappears again, and comes back with more feathers.",
