  "canonical_text": {
    "quote": "",
    "summary": "The passage contains adjacent abstract summaries. In the first, a man separated from his war party receives a root, instructions, and a spirit-bearing skin token from an old wolf, becomes a renowned scout called Wolf Man, and eventually dies in a manner parallel to the wolf. In the second, a man is welcomed by Coyote among coyotes and wolves, receives several medicines and ritual objects from them, and returns home as a medicine-man.",
    "language": "English",
    "quote_policy": "summarized"
  },
  "literal_observations": [
